MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Deducer uses type two, the same as SAS/SPSS

G_2 = ((n+1) g_2 + 6) * (n-1) / ((n-2)(n-3))

ian

